# The marketing site needs exactly two variables, and both are public.
#
# They exist for one page: /story/[slug], the public renderer for a chapter
# shared from the mobile app. It reads the `boards` row whose `share_slug`
# matches, using the anon key against an RLS policy that only exposes rows
# with a slug set. Nothing else on the site touches the database.
#
# There are deliberately no secrets here. The Anthropic, OpenAI, ElevenLabs,
# Stripe and Supabase service-role keys this repo used to carry belonged to the
# web portal, which no longer exists. The mobile app reaches Anthropic through
# a Supabase Edge Function in the authored-by-mobile repo, not through here.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://api.authoredby.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
